sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Ingestion as Ingestion Gateway
    participant RateLimiter as Rate Limiter / Cache
    participant PubSub as Redis Pub/Sub
    participant WS as WebSocket Gateway
    participant DB as Cassandra
    participant Viewer

    User->>Ingestion: POST /comments
    Ingestion->>RateLimiter: Check user rate limits
    RateLimiter-->>Ingestion: OK

    %% Fast Fanout Path
    Ingestion->>PubSub: PUBLISH stream_{id}_comments
    PubSub-->>WS: Deliver message to subscribed gateways
    WS-->>Viewer: Push comment to active stream viewers

    %% Async Persistence Path
    Ingestion->>DB: Async persist comment
    Ingestion-->>User: 201 Created (Accepted)
